<title>HONG KONG: HK 1997/98 public spending to exceed HK$200 bln.</title>
<headline>HK 1997/98 public spending to exceed HK$200 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Secretary for the Treasury K.C. Kwong said on Thursday public expenditure in 1997/98 would exceed HK$200 billion for the first time.  </p>
<p>&quot;For 97/98, the total expenditure is HK$202.2 billion, it is the first time that we will exceed $200 billion,&quot; Kwong told legislators in a briefing.</p>
<p>Hong Kong's Financial Secretary Donald Tsang is due to deliver the 1997/98 budget next Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
